# Keep personal and generated artifacts out of the test image. profiles/ holds
# the resume, per-role profiles, criteria, and config.toml; data/ holds the
# scraped job database; logs/ can hold full prompts including the resume. None
# are needed to run the suite (tests/conftest.py points app.config at its own
# throwaway config), so none should ever be baked into an image layer.
profiles/
data/
logs/

.git/
.github/
.venv/
Pipfile.lock

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
junit_xml_test_report.xml

site/
mockups/
docs/

# NOTE: do not add *.md here. agent/*.md are the pipeline's system prompts —
# runner.py reads them at import/run time and the suite exercises that path.
